    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/859f8be4163d5a6de6433b3aaa6f7f5b.poster.avif?t=1755011166\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/859f8be4163d5a6de6433b3aaa6f7f5b.webm?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/859f8be4163d5a6de6433b3aaa6f7f5b.mp4?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultima Chess VR</strong> is a new kind of strategy fusion with thrilling VR action in the fantasy realm of Ultima. Experience strategy on a new level: <strong>Every move is a clash epic.</strong> Your pieces are brought to life with warriors and magical creatures, and board fighting is filled with special effects, animations, and live commentary. It's not a casual game of chess \u2013 it's a real clash of mind and muscle in virtual reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Classic chess with modern graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Desktop and VR support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Three viewing modes: top-down, from within a world view, and through the mini-map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 12 visual stunning chess deck boards + 3 minimalistic ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 72 unique  chess pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Story campaign with detailed Lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Versus AI (Stockfish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Rapid, blitz, bullet, personalized mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Chess variants: 960 &amp; Fisher random, Fog of War, Bughouse, King of the Hill, 3 Check Chess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/b37b4acc3bc84a0836d4732e5be18d53.poster.avif?t=1755011166\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/b37b4acc3bc84a0836d4732e5be18d53.webm?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/b37b4acc3bc84a0836d4732e5be18d53.mp4?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive gaming:</strong> Complete VR support (SteamVR/Meta Quest) makes the interaction with pieces completely fresh. Experience the presence \u2013 put your feet between pieces, zoom, and fly above and around boards for your ideal shot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic fantasy fighting:</strong> Every capture is a dynamic RPG-style fight. Monsters swipe their claws, heroes unleash special skills, and warriors fight with swords. Chess is a thrilling campaign that can entice viewers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic strategy:</strong> Despite playing a full-fledged chess game with official regulations. The built-in AI player will vary its level depending on your playing level \u2013 beginner, intermediate, and grandmaster levels. Practice needed? The game uses well-proven algorithms (Chess AI) for a clever and fair opponent. Our game relies on one of the strongest chess engines \u2013 Stockfish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of experience:</strong> 12 fantasy-themed stylized boards and a few themed arenas provide a different experience for every game. New boards and factions are unlocked as you advance. The rich variety of characters and environments will appeal to fantasy and traditional chess enthusiasts alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total accessibility:</strong> Uncluttered controls and clear, straightforward instructions make even virtual reality or chess novices play with confidence. From epic fantasy realms to strategic gaming, Ultima Chess VR fulfills for engaging gaming and edge-of-your-seat action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/e94d95e8e6cd6b6a7183f56d342c7204.poster.avif?t=1755011166\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/e94d95e8e6cd6b6a7183f56d342c7204.webm?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/e94d95e8e6cd6b6a7183f56d342c7204.mp4?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A new gaming experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in fantasy: The game occurs within the fantasy world of Ultima Realms, where <strong>12 fantasy factions</strong> clash on your board. Your factions have distinctive appearance and animations \u2013 from noble knights to primordial monsters. Your atmosphere will vary with your choice of theme: you play your games on lavish cities floating in the skies, in historic halls, or on a tropical island filled with pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/e5ee1a883e343db680770298c3d975d7.poster.avif?t=1755011166\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/e5ee1a883e343db680770298c3d975d7.webm?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/e5ee1a883e343db680770298c3d975d7.mp4?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play from a new perspective in VR: Switch between <strong>top-down</strong> (conventional board point of view) and <strong>piece's level mode</strong>, where you stand amongst warring pawns and knights. Immersion is guaranteed \u2013 examine pieces at a close range, observe how they fight, or control combat's dynamics above, as in the case of a commander. To simplify navigation, a mini-board panel, such as on an analogue board, has been implemented.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be a hero in a chess legend:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against formidable foes and rise as a grandmaster among Ultima's players. It's just as fascinating for VR players looking for something new to do as for players of traditional chess looking to bring back old favorites. Be prepared to move off the board \u2013 and onto a legendary battle of wits in <strong><u>Ultima Chess VR.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/a75dd0bfa047ecf4b6cf58fbc507818b.poster.avif?t=1755011166\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/a75dd0bfa047ecf4b6cf58fbc507818b.webm?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551180/extras/a75dd0bfa047ecf4b6cf58fbc507818b.mp4?t=1755011166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's releasing on <strong><u>SEPTEMBER 19 \u2013 ADD TO WISHLIST</u></strong> and don't miss out on it!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
